OL,3,GNEWSAIndustrial estate plagued by '16  
OL,4,Ayears of crime'                        
OL,6,FPeople living near an industrial estate
OL,7,Fare calling for action after a fire in 
OL,8,Fa building that may have contained     
OL,9,Ftoxic materials.                       
OL,11,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service was called
OL,12,Fto a blaze on the Kingswood Douglas    
OL,13,FIndustrial Estate, on the eastern side 
OL,14,Fof Bristol, on Sunday. Residents were  
OL,15,Ftold to keep windows closed due to     
OL,16,Ffears the building contained asbestos. 
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
