OL,3,GNEWSAIndustrial estate plagued by '16  
OL,4,Ayears of crime'                        
OL,6,FCouncillor Sean Rhodes said young      
OL,7,Fpeople were entering the area and      
OL,8,F"creating incredibly dangerous         
OL,9,Fsituations". He said South             
OL,10,FGloucestershire Council was looking at 
OL,11,Fways to fix the issue.                 
OL,13,FResident and gym co-owner Tom Blackman 
OL,14,Fsaid people were "fed up" after 16     
OL,15,Fyears of criminal activity, fires and  
OL,16,Fpeople dumping waste at the site.      
